   "source": "Krish, 2026-11-03: Lock F01, F02 and F04, keep the dachshund",
   "text_sha256": "f73af2949ac40ca62e1acf9acac6d2fe8f72aa7a0540f7153dae170e14fe013e"
  },
  {
